Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.54,Cap,Why do most factories in Egypt lose money on paperwork?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.94,0:00:06.32,Cap,Here is the truth nobody talks about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:12.35,Cap,Last year we ran our own recycling operation in Cairo, and the biggest mistake was simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:22.99,Cap,Two full days every week went to weighbridge tickets and collection logs, written by hand, typed again into Excel, and checked a third time by the accountant.